- [JWT Authentication](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/jwt-authentication): what happens after the password check succeeds.
- [Role Based Authorization](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/role-based-authorization): decide what each logged-in user may do.$sb70$)),
